                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4540' id='721' type-v2='text' w='62518' x='586' y='32395'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The values reflect the average VPS value of 3 groups: bottom 10th percentile, top 10th percentile and middle 80%. Percentiles are based on VPS, excluding zombies, and calculated within each month, market, vertical or vertical segment to display the different businesses we operate on. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>These values serve as guideline of “what’s good” and “what’s not so good” per entity &amp; vertical / vertical segment, to guide ourselves.</run>
